      "url": "https://github.com/pinokiocomputer/pinokio/releases/tag/v8.2.0",
      "notes_html": "<h1>Universal Disk Saver</h1>\n<p>Free up hundreds of gigabytes, even terabytes, of disk space you didn't know you were wasting.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Learn more: <a href=\"https://desktop.pinokio.co/docs/disk-saver/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://desktop.pinokio.co/docs/disk-saver/</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/645348524-ab8a3a60-a7b4-4995-9b98-ff4249d452f6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjQ1MzQ4NTI0LWFiOGEzYTYwLWE3YjQtNDk5NS05Yjk4LWZmNDI0OWQ0NTJmNi5wbmc_.P3wyW4ETJRsEKfv4B_mcYo7UiBCh1DBRPcx5r5R3IFE\"><img width=\"1279\" height=\"634\" alt=\"disksaver\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/645348524-ab8a3a60-a7b4-4995-9b98-ff4249d452f6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjQ1MzQ4NTI0LWFiOGEzYTYwLWE3YjQtNDk5NS05Yjk4LWZmNDI0OWQ0NTJmNi5wbmc_.P3wyW4ETJRsEKfv4B_mcYo7UiBCh1DBRPcx5r5R3IFE\" content-type-secured-asset=\"image/png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 634px;\"></a>\n<h1>Nested Pinokio Folder Support</h1>\n<p>Previously, <code>pinokio.js</code> had to live at the root of a project. Now it can also live at <code>pinokio/pinokio.js</code>, and Pinokio will automatically discover the scripts.</p>\n<p>BEFORE:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"pinokio.js\ninstall.js\nstart.js\nupdate.js\nreset.js\napp.py\nrequirements.txt\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>pinokio.js\ninstall.js\nstart.js\nupdate.js\nreset.js\napp.py\nrequirements.txt\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>AFTER:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"pinokio/\n  pinokio.js\n  install.js\n  start.js\n  update.js\n  reset.js\napp.py\nrequirements.txt\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>pinokio/\n  pinokio.js\n  install.js\n  start.js\n  update.js\n  reset.js\napp.py\nrequirements.txt\n</code></pre></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This means now you can easily pinokio-fy any existing git repository simply by creating an isolated <code>pinokio</code> folder and including all the script files inside it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h1>My Apps</h1>\n<p>Previously you had to click the home icon to go back to Pinokio home, and there was no indication of which tab was selected. Now the default home page is called \"My Apps\", and you can always click the tab to switch to home</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/645767422-83bb4a29-902f-4cbd-b6c7-0557e94ce879.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjQ1NzY3NDIyLTgzYmI0YTI5LTkwMmYtNGNiZC1iNmM3LTA1NTdlOTRjZTg3OS5naWY_.LmsdQ37EQ-9285f9hn6i7agYl1ZWLlgbr2_lEHEDKJ4\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"599\" alt=\"myapps\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/645767422-83bb4a29-902f-4cbd-b6c7-0557e94ce879.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjQ1NzY3NDIyLTgzYmI0YTI5LTkwMmYtNGNiZC1iNmM3LTA1NTdlOTRjZTg3OS5naWY_.LmsdQ37EQ-9285f9hn6i7agYl1ZWLlgbr2_lEHEDKJ4\" content-type-secured-asset=\"image/gif\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 599px;\"></a>\n<h2>Code Signing Policy</h2>\n<p>Free code signing provided by <a href=\"https://signpath.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\">SignPath.io</a>, certificate by <a href=\"https://signpath.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\">SignPath Foundation</a>.</p>\n<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>\n<p>This program will not transfer any information to other networked systems unless specifically requested by the user or the person installing or operating it.</p>",
