      "notes_html": "<h1>8.0.30</h1>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">pinokio-release-cropped.1.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622163796-2799649f-b16b-42cc-9886-f36bae58670e.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTYzNzk2LTI3OTk2NDlmLWIxNmItNDJjYy05ODg2LWYzNmJhZTU4NjcwZS5tcDQ_.K0R_k4lfXuamqmO_OVUCz1JonPTXN-shQ-3rZbBAM4w\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622163796-2799649f-b16b-42cc-9886-f36bae58670e.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTYzNzk2LTI3OTk2NDlmLWIxNmItNDJjYy05ODg2LWYzNmJhZTU4NjcwZS5tcDQ_.K0R_k4lfXuamqmO_OVUCz1JonPTXN-shQ-3rZbBAM4w\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n\n<ol>\n<li>Opencode Plugin</li>\n<li>Hom Server Fix</li>\n<li>Conda Update Fix</li>\n<li>Completely Hide Sidebar</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>1. Opencode plugin</h2>\n<p>Now you can launch Opencode as a plugin, so you can use opencode to ask questions about any app.</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622163326-0c43dc79-c6f9-4c03-be29-962b4c168ec7.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTYzMzI2LTBjNDNkYzc5LWM2ZjktNGMwMy1iZTI5LTk2MmI0YzE2OGVjNy5wbmc_.9EGBe3YT-DrFUDEszSahKxtyHhzSSlp7d3xoZB-Vmrc\"><img width=\"554\" height=\"953\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-15 at 11 04 07 AM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622163326-0c43dc79-c6f9-4c03-be29-962b4c168ec7.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTYzMzI2LTBjNDNkYzc5LWM2ZjktNGMwMy1iZTI5LTk2MmI0YzE2OGVjNy5wbmc_.9EGBe3YT-DrFUDEszSahKxtyHhzSSlp7d3xoZB-Vmrc\" content-type-secured-asset=\"image/png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 953px;\"></a>\n<h2>2. Home Server Fix</h2>\n<p>There was one hole with home server. You could connect to your Pinokio home server from any other machine on the same network (such as another laptop, tablet, or phone), BUT, you couldn't install apps from the Explore page. This is now fixed. Now 100% of the home server features work.</p>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">phoneview2-cropped.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622164379-58967ad8-7d0d-47ea-9669-1bcf7d617621.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTY0Mzc5LTU4OTY3YWQ4LTdkMGQtNDdlYS05NjY5LTFiY2Y3ZDYxNzYyMS5tcDQ_.Wggu8CRBLncNzf5wSKOFLfDnWxCwCXxLZug4BzCVCvo\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622164379-58967ad8-7d0d-47ea-9669-1bcf7d617621.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTY0Mzc5LTU4OTY3YWQ4LTdkMGQtNDdlYS05NjY5LTFiY2Y3ZDYxNzYyMS5tcDQ_.Wggu8CRBLncNzf5wSKOFLfDnWxCwCXxLZug4BzCVCvo\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n\n<h2>3. Conda Update Fix</h2>\n<p>Some people had problem upgrading since Pinokio 8.0.0 because the miniconda/miniforge folders were not getting reset properly (which was needed for these versions). This would happen if one of your other programs were opening one of the files inside pinokio.</p>\n<p>Now when this happens, Pinokio displays precisely which process is holding those files so you can kill them, and once that's done, automatically proceeds with the rest of the update process. For example, here I turn off an older version of Logitech G Hub, after which the update proceeds:</p>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">repair-cropped.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622165721-dd48bf6f-26e9-4519-a8cf-bd7bab29466e.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTY1NzIxLWRkNDhiZjZmLTI2ZTktNDUxOS1hOGNmLWJkN2JhYjI5NDY2ZS5tcDQ_.mDFUGrgAlcBjRYCBlb_zc8W6dInNapallexcNdawWqw\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622165721-dd48bf6f-26e9-4519-a8cf-bd7bab29466e.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTY1NzIxLWRkNDhiZjZmLTI2ZTktNDUxOS1hOGNmLWJkN2JhYjI5NDY2ZS5tcDQ_.mDFUGrgAlcBjRYCBlb_zc8W6dInNapallexcNdawWqw\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n\n<h2>4. Completely Hide Sidebar</h2>\n<p>Previously when you hide the sidebar, it would still show up when you hover your mouse over to the left side of the screen. But often you do not want this. You want your app to take up the full width, period.</p>\n<p>Now you can toggle this behavior by turning off \"Show on hover\". Notice how after you turn it off, it doesn't come back even if you hover your mouse over to the left. You can of course open it by clicking the expand button at the top.</p>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">toggle-cropped.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622166799-57dbae00-05a7-4e6b-bf4d-85bf65c52faa.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTY2Nzk5LTU3ZGJhZTAwLTA1YTctNGU2Yi1iZjRkLTg1YmY2NWM1MmZhYS5tcDQ_.uEIRXi2_dmYiUFarnoXL4fMa6VFFlrWQZAGB32kaQrY\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/121128867/622166799-57dbae00-05a7-4e6b-bf4d-85bf65c52faa.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkxOTY2MDIsIm5iZiI6MTc4OTE5NjMwMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjExMjg4NjcvNjIyMTY2Nzk5LTU3ZGJhZTAwLTA1YTctNGU2Yi1iZjRkLTg1YmY2NWM1MmZhYS5tcDQ_.uEIRXi2_dmYi